# Keycloak 26.7.3 still ships the fixed mssql-jdbc artifact as
# com.microsoft.sqlserver.mssql-jdbc-13.2.1.jre11.jar, but the JAR's embedded
# Maven metadata reports version=13.2.1, so Trivy reports CVE-2025-59250 even
# though the classifier-specific fixed artifact is present. Verified still true
# against the 26.7.3 distribution on 2026-09-03. Revisit when upstream Keycloak
# or Trivy normalizes the jre11 classifier.
CVE-2025-59250 exp:2026-12-03
